  "description": "ARADAC crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C133 H211 Er6 O66 Sn13 1+,6(C3 H7 N1 O1),Cl1 1-. From the CIF bond table, Er1 (Er) has 8 O neighbors; Er4 (Er) has 8 O neighbors; Er6 (Er) has 8 O neighbors; Er8 (Er) has 8 O neighbors; Er3 (Er) has 8 O neighbors; Er2 (Er) has 8 O neighbors; Er10 (Er) has 8 O neighbors; Er12 (Er) has 8 O neighbors; Er7 (Er) has 8 O neighbors; Er9 (Er) has 8 O neighbors; Er5 (Er) has 8 O neighbors; Er11 (Er) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 18 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.653-3.925 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 98.61-113.27°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C151H253ClEr6N6O72Sn13. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ2-O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 13 μ2-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 9 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 6 μ4-O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
